cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
title: Toolkit for Demonstrating Structural Hallucination via Fine-Tuning on a Fabricated Corpus
type: software
# TODO: fill in once this toolkit is archived on Zenodo, following the
# same release pattern as contextual_individuation_toolkit:
# version: v1.0.0
# date-released: 'YYYY-MM-DD'
